{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WARNING: This game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539710/extras/tower.png?t=1745259634\" />Shroom Man's Destination is a 2D arena shooter roguelike where you fight through rooms filled with randomly spawning enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout various encounters, players will collect powerful items to help them escape the underground.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>During your jorney you will find:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">over <strong>100</strong> different items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9</strong> challenging bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">more than <strong>40</strong> varied enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4</strong> randomly generated floors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539710/extras/items.png?t=1745259634\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539710?t=1745259634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539710?t=1745259634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539710/c6afe6012ff6a1e8bd8c67de3012f31bda1ce36b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745259634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539710/c6afe6012ff6a1e8bd8c67de3012f31bda1ce36b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745259634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WARNING: This game may potentiall